OL,3,GNEWSARapist church leader jailed for
OL,4,Anearly 12 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA depraved church leader who preyed on
OL,7,Fa woman's faith and trust, repeatedly
OL,8,Fraping her and filming some of the
OL,9,Fattacks, has been jailed.
OL,11,FBrein Ayeni, head of Christworld Nation
OL,12,Fchurch in Coventry, threatened his
OL,13,Fvictim with claims he would share the
OL,14,Ffootage if she tried to report the
OL,15,Fprolonged abuse, West Midlands Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FThe attacks began in June last year,
OL,19,Fduring which Ayeni would make
OL,20,Fderogatory comments about her,
OL,21,Fcomparing her previous lifestyle
OL,22,Fchoices to poison, the force added.
