OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 43-year-old, from Hurst Road,
OL,7,FCoventry, was sentenced to 11 years and
OL,8,Fnine months in jail after being found
OL,9,Fguilty of three charges of rape and one
OL,10,Fcount of coercive or controlling
OL,11,Fbehaviour.
